  "description": "Won Yu-Ha, a trainee who was unfairly robbed of the chance to appear on a survival program that was expected to be a huge hit, became a 'loser'. After six years of struggling to lead the members who had no motivation, a series of scandals among the members and a sudden traffic accident resulted in him being declared ineligible for a comeback.\n\n *\"If I were born again, I would never become an idol.\"*\n\nJust when he was about to give up on life, determined to never dream of such a life again, \"Appearing on Design Your Idol. You'll give it to me, right?\" He returned to six years ago when he missed the opportunity of a lifetime... ?\n\n『Tutorial: The Crossroads of Life! Spin the Roulette and Decide Your Life!』\n\nAnd what is this thing that just popped up before his eyes?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
